---
import { cvUrl, github, location } from '../../data/profile';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Portrait from './Portrait.astro';
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
	<div class="hero-copy">
		<div class="eyebrow-row">
			<span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Raymond Truong · Software Engineer</span>
		</div>
		<h1 id="hero-title">Software Engineer &amp; <em>Embedded system.</em></h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Hơn 15 năm kinh nghiệm kết hợp Machine Learning, Automation &amp; Embedded system — từ smartwatch algorithm 
			(Step Counting, Sleep Tracking, Activity Recognition,..), phát triển ứng dụng Android Open Source Project
			 đến Firmware IOT (Zephyr RTOS, BLE beacon tracker)
		</p>
		<p class="loc"><Icon name="pin" />{location}</p>
		<div class="actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#kinh-nghiem">Xem kinh nghiệm <Icon name="arrow" size={17} class="go" /></a>
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href={cvUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tải CV (PDF) <Icon name="down" size={17} /></a>
			<a class="btn btn-ghost" href={github} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="gh" size={18} />GitHub</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<Portrait />
</section>
